    "Not commonAncestorContainer": "不是共同祖先容器",
    "Column inside a group must have a width in percentage, not in pixel": "分组内的列宽度必须使用百分比，而非像素",
    "No matching components": "无匹配的组件",
    "Make it easy for everyone to compose emails!": "让每个人都能轻松创建邮件！",
    "This block allows you to display text in your email": "此块用于在邮件中显示文本内容",
    "Displays a customizable button.": "显示一个可自定义的按钮。",
    "Displays a blank space.": "显示空白间隔。",
    "Displays a horizontal divider that can be customized like a HTML border.": "显示可自定义的水平分隔线，样式类似 HTML 边框。",
    "Displays a responsive image in your email. It is similar to the HTML \\'&lt;img/&gt;\\' tag. Note that if no width is provided, the image will use the parent column width.": "在邮件中显示响应式图片，类似于 HTML 的 &lt;img/&gt; 标签。如果未设置宽度，图片将使用父栏的宽度。",
    "This block displays a hero image. It behaves like an \\'section\\' with a single \\'column\\'.": "此块用于显示头图（Hero Image），行为类似于包含单个列的区块。",
    "Displays a menu for navigation with an optional hamburger mode for mobile devices.": "显示导航菜单，支持在移动设备上使用汉堡菜单模式。",
    "Accordion is an interactive component to stack content in tabs, so the information is collapsed and only the titles are visible. Readers can interact by clicking on the tabs to reveal the content, providing a great experience on mobile devices where space is scarce.": "折叠面板是一个交互式组件，可以将内容堆叠在选项卡中。信息默认折叠，仅显示标题。用户可以点击标题展开内容，在移动设备上提供良好的空间利用体验。",
    "This block displays a gallery of images or \\'carousel\\'. Readers can interact by hovering and clicking on thumbnails depending on the email client they use.": "此块用于显示图片轮播。用户可以通过悬停和点击缩略图进行交互，具体取决于所使用的邮件客户端。",
    "Displays calls-to-action for various social networks with their associated logo.": "显示各种社交网络的行动号召按钮及其对应的图标。",
    "Wrapper enables to wrap multiple sections together. It\"s especially useful to achieve nested layouts with shared border or background images across sections.": "包装容器用于将多个区块包裹在一起，特别适合实现具有共享边框或背景图片的嵌套布局。",
    "Sections are intended to be used as rows within your email. They will be used to structure the layout.": "区块（Section）用作邮件中的行，用于构建邮件布局结构。",
    "Sections cannot nest in sections. Columns can nest in sections; all content must be in a column.": "区块不能嵌套在区块中。列可以嵌套在区块中，所有内容必须放在列中。",
    "Group allows you to prevent columns from stacking on mobile. To do so, wrap the columns inside a group block, so they\"ll stay side by side on mobile.": "分组可以防止列在移动设备上堆叠。将列包裹在分组块中，它们将在移动设备上保持并排显示。",
    "Columns enable you to horizontally organize the content within\n                your sections. They must be located under \"Section\" block in order\n                to be considered by the engine. To be responsive, columns are\n                expressed in terms of percentage.": "列用于在区块内横向组织内容。列必须位于"区块（Section）"内才能被引擎识别。为了实现响应式布局，列宽使用百分比表示。",
    "Every single column has to contain something because they are\n                responsive containers, and will be vertically stacked on a mobile\n                view.": "每个列都必须包含内容，因为它们是响应式容器，在移动设备上会垂直堆叠显示。",
    "Allows you to control on which breakpoint the layout should go desktop/mobile.": "允许您控制在哪个断点切换桌面版/移动版布局。",
    "If a personalized text value isn\\\"t available, then a default value is shown.": "如果个性化文本值不可用，则显示默认值。",
    "The image suffix should be .jpg, jpeg, png, gif, etc. Otherwise, the picture may not be displayed normally.": "图片格式应为 .jpg、.jpeg、.png、.gif 等，否则可能无法正常显示。",
